Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:43:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf(ecash): pre-cs_main parallel tx hash warming,
 CheckRegularTransaction, and sighash precomputation

Coordinator historical implementation recovery (2026-10-21):
Restore the original dropped P2P receive-burst precompute purpose using current staged hints, not unsafe whole-batch retry/atomicity. Keep receive order/null/malformed slots and real script verification. Starts after admission004, the first actual four-argument ChainstateManager API; no forwarding shim or future API hoist. Default parallel admission already stages these checks; this recovery serves serial coalesced bursts. Actual shared62253/f7 build and focused tests pass; no claim of native prefix compilation.

